            <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="989bc79d-9e4b-528b-b966-eff3ce994cc7">Psionic Shockwave – All Characters and Independent Characters slain by this model explode in a S4 AP- in a 6” Radius. This does not affect friendly models.</characteristic>
