        <rule id="9c71c866-ebb9-5d97-8427-5679a37eb2f9" name="Cleaving Counterblow" hidden="false">
          <description>each Melee attack made against Obyron in a Challenge that misses grants Obyron one additional attack at Initiative Step Slow.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="56b2c455-8223-50d5-b034-be5ed9b9b8b5" name="Ghostwalk Mantle" hidden="false">
          <description>At the end of your Movement Phase you may remove Vargard Obyron and the unit he is joined to and Deepstrike them back onto the Table. If Deepstriking within 12” Of Nemesor Zahndrekh do not scatter. One Use Only.</description>
        </rule>
