      <rules>
        <rule id="5ca7e7e7-827d-598f-a931-52984468e98f" name="Agents of the Silent King" hidden="false">
          <description>This is cast as a unit. This model does not suffer the Autowounds from losing Combat Resolution as a Fearless model. If a friendly Necron unit within 6” fails Combat Resolution and does not pass their Ld Test, instead of suffering Autowounds remove one model from the game (no Reanimation) and the unit is considered to have passed the test. Canoptek units are immune to this rule.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
