      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="9a713f24-2773-5428-af5e-41b3d1443ed6" name="Death" hidden="false">
          <description>Each time this model is nominated to fight in Melee, it inflicts an Autowound with AP2+ on each model in base contact, friend or foe.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="6679bb3e-f4b1-5412-9507-911c60a7c1c9" name="Gaze of Death" hidden="false">
          <description>In the Shooting Phase, you may target a unit within 12”. The unit takes a Ld test on 3d6, dropping the lowest die. For each point the Ld test failed by, the unit suffers an Autowound with AP2+. This overrides the normal AP- of Autowounds. If this does any Wounds to the target, the Nightbringer Heals 1 Wound as an exception to the normal Heal rules.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="bc95810d-af72-5d03-a971-e8a31379b6ad" name="Immune to Natural Law" hidden="false">
          <description>Ignores models and Terrain for moving. May not fire Overwatch with C’Tan Powers. This model ignores the extra Wound it suffers from Monsterbane.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
